# Keeps this directory present in a fresh clone.
#
# avro-maven-plugin is bound to generate-sources and fails the build outright when neither
# src/main/resources/avro nor src/test/avro is a directory:
#
#   Failed to execute goal org.apache.avro:avro-maven-plugin:schema (default) on project
#   contract: neither sourceDirectory ... or testSourceDirectory ... are directories
#
# Git does not track empty directories, so without this file the build passes on a developer
# machine (where the directory exists) and fails in CI (where the clone has no such path).
#
# Remove this file once real .avsc schemas live here, or once SKL-9 decides against Avro and
# the plugin is removed.
